{
 "encounter_id": "00549",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, I am getting breathless even on flat ground. Since long time only, and now it is more."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay, sit, sit. How long is long time? Months, or years?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three years. Maybe little more."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How far can you walk on the flat before you have to stop?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "One block, maybe. Then I stop."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And when you stop, does anything help?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sitting for a while. Five minutes, then it is okay."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Is there any cough with it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, cough in the morning. White phlegm comes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did the cough start?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't know, doctor. Maybe last year, maybe before that also. I cannot say exactly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No problem, we will not worry about the date. Do you get any whistling in the chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, wheezing at night, sometimes. It wakes me up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling in the ankles or feet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Little bit, swelling in my feet, in the evening. By morning it is gone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Now a few things I must rule out. Any chest pain, any fever, or any blood when you cough?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain. No fever. No blood also."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. What medicines are you taking at present?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Blue inhaler, salbutamol, when needed. Amlodipine 5 mg once a day. Metformin 500 mg twice a day. And atorvastatin 20 mg at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Those three tablets, are they for diabetes, blood pressure and cholesterol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. Diabetes, high blood pressure, high cholesterol. All three. Diabetes is ten years now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Understood. Any allergy to any medicine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. Rash all over the body."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. Any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hernia operation, in 2015."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anyone in the family with heart or lung problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Father had heart attack, at sixty. Lungs, nobody."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke, or have you smoked?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Used to. Beedi, fifteen a day, for many years. Stopped in 2018."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Well done for stopping. And what work did you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cement factory, thirty years. Retired now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hmm. Cement dust is not good for the lungs. Stomach and bowels, all okay?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All fine, no problem there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Let me do your vitals now. Please don't talk for a minute.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure is 138/86, pulse 92 bpm, respiratory rate 22 breaths/min, oxygen saturation 93 %, and temperature 37.1 \u00b0C. Now open your shirt, I will listen to your chest.",
   "pause": 15
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cold stethoscope, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sorry, sorry. Breathe in deeply, and out. I can hear wheeze on both sides when you breathe out, and the air entry is reduced at both bases.",
   "pause": 14
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What is it, doctor? Is it serious?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me be clear. With your smoking history and the cement dust, this looks most likely like chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. That is my working impression, not final."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "COPD? My neighbour has that. He is on oxygen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "He may be a more advanced case. Yours we will assess properly, and I do not want you to jump ahead."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. What tests?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray, spirometry, which is a blowing test to measure your lungs, and a blood count. All three today if the lab has time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Spirometry, is it painful?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not painful. You blow hard into a tube, three times. A little tiring, that is all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, I can do that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Keep using your blue inhaler when needed, and keep your tablets as they are for now. Do not change anything before the tests."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, doctor. Same only."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Also, if the breathlessness suddenly becomes much worse, or your lips turn blue, or you have chest pain, go to the emergency department straight away."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Emergency, straight away. Okay."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Come back and see me in two weeks, with the reports, and we will decide the treatment then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks. I will tell my son to bring me, I don't like to take the bus now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very good idea. Any other questions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "One thing. Can I climb stairs to the second floor, to my daughter's house?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Go slowly, stop on the landing. If you get too breathless, rest. No hero work."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No hero work. Okay, doctor, thank you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Welcome. Ask the front desk for the lab forms on your way out."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Forms from front desk. Thank you."
  }
 ],
